  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by SolarisMAX Gen3. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Solaris.\n\nYears of production: 2016-2017\n\nThe Solaris is our flagship big wheel hardtail: 29er or 27.5+. Our fastest hardtail got faster: the latest thinking on bike fit and progressive handling with OFI geometry, plus 27.5+ tyre compatibility, made a fast, future-proofed, fun machine.\n\nHandling is confidence inspiring, interactive and fun, with a planted feel at high speed on the rocks and carve-it-up traction in the corners. As always, the Reynolds 853 front triangle is all present and correct. Signature features such as the Ovalform top tube and 35mm seat tube keep weight, stiffness and durability in the sweet spot.\n\nThe result is amazing adaptability: from suspension-forked, big-barred trail warrior, to Plus-tyred, high-traction monster truck, to rigid-forked map-crossing smoothie, and everything in between.\n\nFinishes: Gloss Hot Yellow, Gloss Gunmetal and Matte Orange.\nSizes: Medium (17.5\"), Large (19\") and XL (20.5\").",
